{
  "about": "The NPC say window (issue #445): 280x180 at (200, 100), text wrapped character by character at 215 px on a grey panel, no auto-scroll; the wheel scrolls 30 px, the window drags by its frame, the old page stays after Next until the next one comes, and a clear empties the text but keeps the window. The NPC (npc/say.txt) is loaded with @loadnpc and unloaded at both ends.",
